1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,377
My name is Kshetrabasi Juanga.

2
00:00:02,544 --> 00:00:07,382
I teach children in a government school.

3
00:00:07,382 --> 00:00:11,177
I live in...Kendujhar district.

4
00:00:11,177 --> 00:00:16,391
I am very proud of my Juang language and culture.

5
00:00:16,975 --> 00:00:22,772
My Juang language and culture have helped me grow.

6
00:00:23,231 --> 00:00:28,236
Because I have made great progress through Juang language and culture,

7
00:00:28,528 --> 00:00:34,534
IN ODIA: ..so...I'm grateful to Juang language and culture forever.

8
00:00:34,868 --> 00:00:39,164
So I always...always tell people that

9
00:00:39,164 --> 00:00:42,208
if the language and culture survive, the Juang people will survive.
